#: indico_blockschedule/plugin.py
msgid "Enabled by default"
msgstr "デフォルトで有効"

#: indico_blockschedule/plugin.py
msgid ""
"Turn the Block Schedule feature on for new events without a manager "
"having to enable it. Events where a feature has already been switched on "
"or off keep whatever they were set to."
msgstr "新しいイベントで、管理者が有効にしなくても Block Schedule 機能を使えるようにします。すでに機能のオン・オフを切り替えたイベントは、その設定のまま変わりません。"

#: indico_blockschedule/plugin.py indico_blockschedule/templates/display.html
#: indico_blockschedule/templates/manage.html
msgid "Block Schedule"
msgstr "Block Schedule"

#: indico_blockschedule/plugin.py
msgid ""
"Gives event managers a grid-based timetable: time down the rows, rooms "
"across the columns."
msgstr "イベント管理者にグリッド形式のタイムテーブルを提供します。行が時間、列が部屋です。"

#: indico_blockschedule/templates/track_colors.html
msgid "Track colours"
msgstr "トラックの色"

